	(property "Design notes" "One isolated channel only. Pin7 unused: ADC uses internal references. CORE J3 direct controller must be disconnected when this extension drives RUN/ARM/HB. FAULT_CLEAR_N is C1 U16.6, not raw FAULT_N from old J3/J5. Requires deliberate harness adapter; do not wire by connector pin number similarity."
